<comment>
Session 008 canonical fresh t=0 companion-supported AMD assessment.
Approved local orthonormal speed = 0.133215; left -y, right +y; CCW from +z.
Approximate companion motivation: v_new^2 ~ v_old^2 + 0.12/(4*3), G=1.
This is not exact GR binary equilibrium. No new pusher force or velocity tuning.
Source masses 0.76+0.12+0.12=1 define M_ref=1 inherited units, not measured ADM,
rest, or horizon mass. Envelope areal R=30, centers isotropic Cartesian +/-3.
Approximate conformally flat K_ij=0 leaves the local momentum constraint unsolved.
Fresh 5,000,000 deterministic particles, seed4001; sampling asymmetry retained.
Initial coordinate period ~227 in combined metric; t=12 is early assessment only.
Domain +/-256, root dx=2, root logical3, physical levels0..9, dx_min=1/256.
Initial compact towers reach dx=1/64; Lohner0.2, tracker_floor=false.
Outflow/Sommerfeld boundary: sqrt(2) gauge estimate reaches R=30 at ~159.8.
Extraction40..70 uses inherited dx=2 propagation grid. Raw r*Psi4 ell2..8 retained;
t=12 does not cover central-collapse waves at these spheres or merger/ringdown.
No common-horizon, removal-plateau, or mass-plateau early science stop is enabled.
Assessment endpoint t=12, maximum48 raw AMD node-hours including preparation.
<job>
basename = s8_companion_supported

<mesh>
nghost = 4
nx1 = 256
x1min = -256.0
x1max = 256.0
ix1_bc = outflow
ox1_bc = outflow
nx2 = 256
x2min = -256.0
x2max = 256.0
ix2_bc = outflow
ox2_bc = outflow
nx3 = 256
x3min = -256.0
x3max = 256.0
ix3_bc = outflow
ox3_bc = outflow

<meshblock>
nx1 = 32
nx2 = 32
nx3 = 32

<time>
evolution = dynamic
integrator = rk4
cfl_number = 0.4
nlim = 100000000
tlim = 12.0
ndiag = 50
stop_file = REQUEST_STOP
stop_check_every = 16

<mesh_refinement>
refinement = adaptive
num_levels = 10
max_nmb_per_rank = 240
ncycle_check = 16
refinement_interval = 16

<amr_criterion1>
method = user

<z4c_amr>
